⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
303 calories 32g protein (yes for the whole pint)😋🤤

Cherry Garcia Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my E-Book
Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 1 Vanilla Protein Shake (I like the ones from @Raw Nutrition or @Nurri)
- 100g cherries (fresh or frozen)
- 35g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
Homemade chocolate chips using:
- 15g chocolate chips
- 2g coconut oil
303 cal 28g C, 9g F, 32g P

Instructions:
1. Pour the cherries into the pint and cover with the sweetener, salt, and xanthan gum
2. Let sit for a few minutes to macerate
3. Cover the cherries with the protein shake
4. Shake up the pint and freeze (at least 16 hours)
5. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
6. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
7. Spin on “Respin” setting
8. Respin again if powdery
9. Combine 15g of chocolate with 2g of coconut oil, melt in the microwave (30 sec intervals, stirring in between), hollow out a hole in the center of the base, and pour in
10. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

